{"id":"b8abd4dee01cbe0f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-mouse-sharp.md","title":"ZFC Mouse Sharp","display":"df-zfc-mouse-sharp — ZFC Mouse Sharp","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-mouse-sharp","aliases":["58-df-zfc-mouse-sharp"],"display":"df-zfc-mouse-sharp — ZFC Mouse Sharp","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner-active-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-model7-premouse]]","[[58-df-zfc-model7-sound-premouse]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-mouse-sharp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-mouse-sharp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-mouse-sharp — ZFC Mouse Sharp"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e887d21653cfd36f\" href=\"?note=e887d21653cfd36f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner-active-premouse\">58-df-zfc-inner-active-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3ea3dede2645310a\" href=\"?note=3ea3dede2645310a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse\">58-df-zfc-model7-iterable-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1048d44b28527ff2\" href=\"?note=1048d44b28527ff2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-premouse\">58-df-zfc-model7-premouse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b90acdf2f9519ffd\" href=\"?note=b90acdf2f9519ffd\" title=\"58-df-zfc-model7-sound-premouse\">58-df-zfc-model7-sound-premouse</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MouseSharp}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{MouseSharp}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ordinal}\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,a,\\rho,p\\in V\">\\(M,N,a,\\rho,p\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}\">\\(J_\\alpha^{\\vec E}\\)</span> is the premouse hierarchy used by the canonical premouse code</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S\\)</span> are the canonical unary premouse predicates</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> takes a premouse, projectum candidate, and standard parameter</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is defined below from the premouse codes</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MouseSharp}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{MouseSharp}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}proper\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S(N,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U,W,\\vec E,\\vec F,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M=\\langle U,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land N=\\langle W,\\in,\\vec F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)=\\beta\\land\\vec F=\\vec E\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\land U=J_\\beta^{\\vec E}\\land W=J_\\alpha^{\\vec F}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}premouse\\text{-}proper\\text{-}initial\\text{-}segment} \\vdash \\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S(N,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists U,W,\\vec E,\\vec F,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M=\\langle U,\\in,\\vec E\\rangle\\land N=\\langle W,\\in,\\vec F\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec E)=\\beta\\land\\vec F=\\vec E\\upharpoonright\\alpha\\land U=J_\\beta^{\\vec E}\\land W=J_\\alpha^{\\vec F}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}sharp} \\vdash \\mathrm{MouseSharp}_S(M,a) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(M)\\land\\exists\\rho\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S(M,\\rho,a)\\land\\forall N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S(N,M)\\to\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S(N,\\sigma,a))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mouse\\text{-}sharp} \\vdash \\mathrm{MouseSharp}_S(M,a) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcModel7Premouse}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(M)\\land\\exists\\rho\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S(M,\\rho,a)\\land\\forall N\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PremouseInitialSegment}_S(N,M)\\to\\neg\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcInnerActivePremouse}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7IterablePremouse}_S(N)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel7SoundPremouse}_S(N,\\sigma,a))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sharp is the least active, sound, iterable premouse with standard parameter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>; proper initial segment is explicitly tied to restriction of the extender sequence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"